---

  <section class="care" id="care">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="care-head">
        <h2 class="h-section reveal">Care built around the person.</h2>
        <p class="lead reveal">Every care line runs on the same clinical depth and the same warmth. The goal never changes. Meet people where they are and move them toward home.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="care-cards">
        <div class="care-card reveal">
          <div class="cc-photo"><img src="/img/reception.jpg" alt="The welcome desk at a Heartwell community" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="cc-body">
            <h3>Skilled Nursing</h3>
            <p>Round-the-clock licensed nursing with the clinical depth to manage complex needs close to home.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="care-card reveal">
          <div class="cc-photo"><img src="/img/gym.jpg" alt="The Heartwell rehabilitation gym" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="cc-body">
            <h3>Subacute Rehabilitation</h3>
            <p>Physical, occupational, and speech therapy focused on one goal. Getting people home, stronger.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="care-card reveal">
          <div class="cc-photo"><img src="/img/hands.jpg" alt="A caregiver holding a resident&rsquo;s hands" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="cc-body">
            <h3>Long-Term Care</h3>
            <p>A true home for residents who need daily support, with dignity built into every detail.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="care-card reveal">
          <div class="cc-photo"><img src="/img/visit.jpg" alt="Family visiting a resident" loading="lazy"></div>
          <div class="cc-body">
            <h3>Memory Care</h3>
            <p>Specialized, secure support for residents living with Alzheimer&rsquo;s and dementia, anchored at Wood Glen in Dayton.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
